moyu (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add local web reader with bookshelf, covers, typography settings,
    paged and scrolling modes, and page-turn animations.
  * Add shelf hide (keep file) and permanent local delete actions.
  * Add Markdown reading and web file import for TXT/EPUB/PDF/Markdown.
  * Add `moyu web` command, desktop launcher, moyu:// URL scheme and PWA
    support.

 -- moyu-reader contributors <moyu-reader@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:18:48 +0800

